  "about": "Expected result-block values for the Pendulane rehearsal ROM and the release ROM's auto QA run, judged by tools/judge.py. Block layout: arm9/source/game/rehearsal.h. Every timing value is the difference of two edges found with the ITCM nop sled (judge/bench.c), so the fixed path cancels; ranges are in ARM9 cycles (half bus cycles) unless the title says otherwise. \"signed\" items are compared as s32. \"known\" lists, per emulator version and renderer, the gating items expected to fail there; judge.py --profile passes only when the failing set matches exactly.",
