      "rom": "pendulane-rehearsal.nds",
      "item_id": 1213350992,
      "item_id_text": "PDRH",
      "frames": 3500,
      "note": "the scripted play of the first contraption of every chapter, then the bench; no save chip, no NitroFS"
    },
    "qa": {
      "rom": "pendulane.nds",
      "item_id": 1314013521,
      "item_id_text": "QARN",
      "frames": 6000,
      "note": "the release ROM's hidden auto QA mode (title: hold L+R+X+Y for 120 frames): every contraption of every chapter solved by the scripted player with each chapter's rhythm piece, the credits, then the bench once; the block uses the rehearsal's layout and adds the QA words at values[48..54]"
    }
  },
